cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ROPA30, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ROPA30"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ROPA30 is a free, open-source, local-first web application for keeping
  the records of processing activities required by Article 30 of Regulation
  (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), both the controller's record (Art. 30(1)) and the
  processor's record (Art. 30(2)). It provides a bilingual (Italian/English)
  library of pre-filled templates for common processing activities and
  exports records to XLSX, ODS and PDF. It has no backend and makes no
  external connections: all data is stored locally in the user's browser.
